Problems I ran into, and how to troubleshoot them?
Upgrading Azure membership to allow multi-subscription setup. Waiting for a time window that blocks new Subscription creation
Working in the wrong directory after the bootstrapping phase. DevOps pipeline kept displaying the same output even after making changes to the platform tfvars file.

