What would I change if this were supporting real production traffic?
I would add some of the features that were disabled to avoid incurring high costs like:
Azure Firewall for centralized network security
Private DNS and DNS Resolver
DDoS Network Protection
Production Microsoft Defender for Cloud plans
Dedicated Identity and Security services
Centralized Security Information and Event Management (SIEM)
Add multi-region disaster recovery to current DR setup
More granular policy and compliance enforcement
Automate workload landing-zone deployments like the platform






